      "reason": "volcello supplies tracer-cell volume for the volume weights and for deriving layer thickness when selecting and weighting the 200-1000 m layer.",
      "status": "condensed",
      "notes": [
        "Layer thickness and volume weights come from the model's own `volcello`, which accounts for partial bottom cells. Do not use `lev_bnds` differences (14% of GFDL cells differ by more than 1%). No `thkcello` is available locally. Record `attrs['volume_source']` and report it."
      ]
